ence/evaluate\\_final.py}). The five recorded partitions have durations that sum to about 1332 seconds, against a wall-clock limit of 5400 seconds in the same script. % @evidence[[source_evidence/evaluate_final.py]] @evidence[[paper_data.json#final_evaluation.evaluation_evidence.episodes]]\nartifact-manifest.schema.json\nevidence-reference.schema.json\nledger-entry.schema.json\nverification-report.schema.json\n129:Both point estimates lie below the nominal 0.95. Under exact binomial calculations with $p=0.95$, the lower-tail probabilities of the observed counts are 0.066 (pooled) and 0.063 (lowest family), % @evidence[[analysis/headroom_derived.json#coverage]]\n130:which is why the gate did not reject, but also not strong support for exact nominal coverage; the Monte Carlo standard errors are 0.011 and 0.029. % @evidence[[analysis/headroom_derived.json#coverage]]\n136:Most of the gain over labeled-only inference is therefore already captured by PPI machinery; recalibration adds a small increment on top. Per family, the narrowing against PPI++ is 0.0287 for census income, 0.0018 for census insurance, 0.0023 for census education, 0.0359 for plankton and 0.0413 for the synthetic mixture, corresponding to derived width reductions of 2.8\\%, 0.2\\%, 0.2\\%, 3.5\\% and 4.0\\%. % @evidence[[paper_data.json#final_evaluation.metrics]] @evidence[[analysis/headroom_derived.json#derived_width_reduction_vs_ppi_pp]]","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
